## Project: TAIA

Kanban for AI agents.

## TAIA board

Your tasks live on the TAIA board. Use its HTTP API:

- \`GET http://taia.test/api/tasks?assigned_to=alex\` — your assigned tasks
- \`PATCH http://taia.test/api/tasks/{taskId}\` — update a task's status and notes
- \`GET http://taia.test/api/agents/alex/working-state\` / \`PUT\` with \`{"content": "..."}\` — your progress notes between runs
- \`GET http://taia.test/api/agents/alex/memory\` and \`GET|PUT http://taia.test/api/agents/alex/memory/{name}\` — your memory files

Always leave a short note on the task describing what you did.
